OL,3,GNEWSAPolice launch new CCTV hub to
OL,4,A'boost public safety'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say a CCTV hub will "boost
OL,7,Fpublic safety and support crime
OL,8,Fprevention" across Oxfordshire.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police (TVP) has
OL,11,Fofficially launched its new countywide
OL,12,FCCTV control room at Abingdon Police
OL,13,FStation.
OL,15,FThe development is part of the Thames
OL,16,FValley CCTV Partnership - with local
OL,17,Fauthorities in the county agreeing to
OL,18,Ftransfer their cameras in public spaces
OL,19,Fto police.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
