OL,3,GNEWSAPolice launch new CCTV hub to
OL,4,A'boost public safety'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme has been fronted by the
OL,7,FPolice and Crime Commissioner (PCC)
OL,8,FMatthew Barber, who said the hub was a
OL,9,F"really big step forward".
